BEHAVIOR pow

DESCRIPTION
  Integer exponentiation: base raised to a non-negative exponent.
  exp <= 0 yields 1. Uses a simple multiply loop; wraps on overflow (no check).

CONTRACT
  INPUT base int 8
  INPUT exp int 8
  OUTPUT result int 8
  GUARANTEES pure no_alloc writes_output

HASH 043e5cdd

IMPLEMENTATION
  basev = LOAD base 8
  expv = LOAD exp 8
  acc = 1
  i = 0

  LABEL loop
    done = IGE i expv 8
    BRANCH done finish body

  LABEL body
    acc = IMUL acc basev 8
    i = IADD i 1 8
    JUMP loop

  LABEL finish
    STORE result acc 8
END
